o di terrore quando scoprono che le rovine sommerse sono terreno di caccia per i micidiali squali bianchi. Con la riserva d'aria che diminuisce inesorabilmente, le quattro amiche dovranno muoversi nel labirinto sottomarino di caverne claustrofobiche e tunnel inquietanti in cerca di una via d'uscita da quell'inferno acquoso.","tagline":"La paura è profonda."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Four teenage girls go on a diving adventure to explore a submerged Mayan city. Once inside, their rush of excitement turns into a jolt of terror as they discover the sunken ruins are a hunting ground for deadly great white sharks. With their air supply steadily dwindling, the friends must navigate the underwater labyrinth of claustrophobic caves and eerie tunnels in search of a way out of their watery hell.","tagline":"Fear runs deep."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmYHKQ7T2PrmMI1OuzWK3M7aZPi.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmYHKQ7T2PrmMI1OuzWK3M7aZPi.png","language":"en","width":788,"height":273},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGpm4LlvTWDblfyTTVYmG1mLgsV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sGpm4LlvTWDblfyTTVYmG1mLgsV.png","language":"en","width":1276,"height":435},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wLoHKKZCfPgfeSnUnJv3FY6nMb.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wLoHKKZCfPgfeSnUnJv3FY6nMb.png","language":"xx","width":1549,"height":221}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjiuptyDZQ6FgP6YY3pScwa3atD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjiuptyDZQ6FgP6YY3pScwa3atD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9fwUPRNY7vQ8qTqkfpYWoHUTHGv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9fwUPRNY7vQ8qTqkfpYWoHUTHGv.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1417},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g4z7